lmms-web: ZynAddSubFX in the web build runs only in LMMS's own process (LocalZynAddSubFx), as
it does elsewhere while its window is closed: no FLTK window (zynaddsubfx_gui, fluid) and no
separate process (RemoteZynAddSubFx, the remote plugin), which a web page can't start.

Applies to LMMS v1.3.0-alpha.2 (GPL-2.0-or-later).

diff --git a/plugins/ZynAddSubFx/CMakeLists.txt b/plugins/ZynAddSubFx/CMakeLists.txt
